    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.6/p@137609",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MALCOLM.\nNow near enough. Your leafy screens throw down,\nAnd show like those you are.—You, worthy uncle,\nShall with my cousin, your right noble son,\nLead our first battle: worthy Macduff and we\nShall take upon’s what else remains to do,\nAccording to our order.",
